                "severity": "SUGGESTION",
                "claim": "RemoveEmptySkillDirs is best effort and reports any directory it could not read or remove as kept. The CLI then prints 'it holds files skills install did not write', which is inaccurate for a permission or I/O failure. No test covers a failing ReadDir or Remove. The uninstall still exits 0 with the files and record gone, so the outcome is safe; only the note can mislead. The task notes already carry this as a known follow-up.",
